{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/prosiform/pulls/670","id":5187835089,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVNSvEM8AAAABNTgU0Q","html_url":"https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/pull/670","diff_url":"https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/pull/670.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/pull/670.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/prosiform/issues/670","number":670,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[I10:E07] Compile and publish effective preset variants","user":{"login":"m2ux","id":176900785,"node_id":"U_kgDOCotKsQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176900785?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux","html_url":"https://github.com/m2ux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Overview\n\nDelivers I10:E07 W06+W07: dispatches of one document under different effective preset selections produce separate bundles, while equivalent requests compile once and share a deterministic filename. Inline and parallel links name their selected bundles, and variant cycles, budgets and publication checks apply to the same canonical identities.\n\n## Changes\n\nEach compiled bundle owns its effective selection and its first published occurrence for each outgoing selection.\n\n### Compilation And Analysis\n\n- **Canonical scheduling.**\n  `src/prosiform/cli.py` schedules document, fragment and matched declared preset sets independently of raw tag spelling and filenames.\n- **Variant graph checks.**\n  `src/prosiform/dispatch.py` counts sibling selections as separate depth hops and refuses a cycle only when an effective selection repeats.\n- **Per-bundle facts.**\n  File/output budgets restart for each compilation; substitution diagnostics retain distinct declared alternatives and preset-owned unused pairs.\n\n### Publication And Validation\n\n- **Occurrence destinations.**\n  Shared provenance and rewriting retain raw requested tags alongside the target and operator, so every original link receives its selected file or set heading.\n- **Parallel membership.**\n  Equivalent requests share one generated member; distinct selections retain separate members, including links inside headings.\n- **Captured heading facts.**\n  Both assembly passes use captured destination conversions for effective set cardinality, with no additional source capture for unselected headings.\n- **Independent candidate checks.**\n  `src/prosiform/candidate.py` checks each file destination and generated set against selected bundle names, using renderer identities for repeated generated headings.\n- **Atomic collision refusal.**\n  Distinct selections deriving one filename fail before parallel aliasing or publication; normal/check modes preserve any earlier set.\n\n## Test Plan\n\n| Test | Description | Coverage | Pass |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| T1 | Actual two-selection compilations and language-neutral corpus compare separate filenames and selected bodies. | AC12 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w06-compilation-schedules-distinct-selection/validation.md#distinct-bundle-selections) |\n| T2 | Reordered, repeated, case-folded, empty/default and unmatched requests compile once and share the exact contract filename. | AC13 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w06-compilation-schedules-distinct-selection/validation.md#equivalent-requests-and-names) |\n| T3 | Graph and real-run tests exercise sibling entry variants, equivalent cycles, dispatch depth, warning locations and fresh file/output budgets. | AC14 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w06-compilation-schedules-distinct-selection/validation.md#variant-graphs-and-budgets) |\n| T4 | Direct/body/heading-inline parallel publication, equivalent members and tampered candidate mappings verify the selected bundle for each occurrence. | AC15 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w06-compilation-schedules-distinct-selection/validation.md#selected-dispatch-publication) |\n| T5 | Injected collisions in inline, parallel-body and heading-inline placements preserve a previous set in normal/check modes. | AC16 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w06-compilation-schedules-distinct-selection/validation.md#collision-atomicity) |\n| T6 | The complete repository gate runs at the committed source head through the configured external build and deterministic harness. | | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w06-compilation-schedules-distinct-selection/validation.md#full-check) |\n| T7 | Updated-base variant, candidate and generated deferred-title interactions pass 114 observing cases. | | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w06-compilation-schedules-distinct-selection/validation.md#current-base-interaction) |\n\n## References\n\n- **R1.** [Explicit preset-selection design](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/795bbfb67c66b02193f0313138f59f18aa6c5274/artifacts/planning/2026-10-17-prosiform-v1/design.md) — effective selection identities, qualified names and dispatch semantics.\n","created_at":"2026-11-0